DESCRIPTION:Brainwashed is a dark comedy about being the most beautiful bab
 y in a brutal dictatorship. Born in the Soviet Union and raised in Belarus\
 , Alina Konon takes her personal experience with propaganda and turns it in
 to a soup. Expect propaganda\, audience participation\, and the appearance 
 of some notable Soviet figures. It's personal\, political\, and unhinged. B
 rainwashed previously sold out at Hollywood Fringe and won the Best of Acto
 rs Company Award.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/br
 ainwashed/
